    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The petitioner Paramananda Jani @ Dal has filed this Contempt Petition as the opposite parties have flouted the order dated 17.05.2024 passed in W.P.(C) No.12332 of 2024, wherein direction was issued to dispose of the L.A.R. Case No.65 of 2017 within a period of three months from the date of production of the certified copy and if the application under section 28-A of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 is allowed, then the compensation amount be disbursed to the petitioner within a period of two months thereafter.\nLearned counsel for the State seeks some time to obtain instruction relating to the status of the application under section 28-A of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894.",
